@1 = ~– Alignment restricted to good.
~

@2 = ~8th level: May cast Animal Summoning I.~

@3 = ~10th level: May cast Animal Summoning II.~

@4 = ~12th level: May cast Animal Summoning III.~

@5 = ~May cast Animal Summoning I as an innate ability once per day at level 1. Gains additional uses per day at levels 3 and 5.~

@6 = ~May cast Animal Summoning II as an innate ability once per day at level 5. Gains additional uses per day at levels 7 and 9.~

@7 = ~May cast Animal Summoning III as an innate ability once per day at level 9. Gains additional uses per day at levels 12 and 15.
–Summoned animals receive bonus of 1 to THAC0 and AC and 10% increase in HP at level 1. The bonuses increase by further 1 THAC0/AC and 10% HP at level 5 and every 5th level thereafter until +7 and +70% at level 30.
–Summoned animals receive a 10% bonus to all resistances at level 10. This bonus increases by a further 10% every fifth level thereafter until 50% at level 30.~